      "settings": {
        "checksum": "e2e738ef5014ff148fda4e0aed7706c0f9584a0d7891e25243f480ee38b755d5_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-AQUUPmIu_text": "<p>Look, I understand.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You have been burned before.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Spent money on \"breakthrough\" longevity products that did nothing measurable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Read every Reddit thread on NMN and walked away unsure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I am going to make this as simple as I possibly can.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Run the full three-layer AgeAura Pure Protocol for 90 days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If, at the end of those 90 days, you do not see the energy, sleep, recovery, and clarity shifts I have described in this letter — or if your bloodwork does not move — you write to my team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We refund you in full.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No interrogation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No retention script.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No catch.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I can offer this guarantee because, in practice, our return rate runs under 2%.</p>",
        "gg-wX0_y_wF_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(26,26,26);\">Here are the life-changing results men and women over 40 have experienced:</span></p>",
        "gg0DLIZ1coR_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-urolithin-lifestyle-asian-woman.webp",
        "gg1PLJBeCLv_text": "BUT HERE'S THE CATCH (AND IT'S A REAL ONE)",
        "gg1ZYkq7Z-X_text": "<p>First it was friendly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A colleague I have known for eighteen years pulled me aside at a longevity-medicine conference and told me, kindly, that what I was describing was \"going to make a lot of people uncomfortable.\" Then it was less friendly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A polite letter from a supplement industry trade association suggesting I \"reconsider how I framed my findings publicly.\" Then a regulatory body opened an inquiry - no findings, just an inquiry, that took six months to resolve.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The reason is obvious.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>American supplement companies make their money selling you one compound at a time, at the lowest possible dose that can legally carry the name on the label.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>American pharmaceutical companies cannot patent NMN.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They cannot patent Urolithin A.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They cannot patent naturally occurring peptide sequences.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is nobody with a stock price who is incentivized to put this on the news.</p><p>Addresses the ROOT CAUSE of biological aging (all three layers - not one at a time)</p><p>Costs less than one month at any concierge longevity clinic</p><p>Delivered to your door - no $200,000 Swiss retreat, no clinic membership fee</p><p>But here is what the trade associations didn't count on… the patients getting their lives back weren't going to stay quiet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They told their spouses.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They told their friends.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They told their cardiologists.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The information was moving faster than anyone could shut it down.</p>",
        "gg1eT2Uc1md_text": "<p><strong>Dr. Marcus Hale, MD</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(101,103,107)!important;\"><strong>Longevity Medicine &amp; Translational Biology (26 years)</strong></span></p>",
        "gg3LdCrsRwi_label": "<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg3bgK4J8d__text": "THE CHOICE THAT DEFINES YOUR NEXT DECADE",
        "gg3sLyvdeG7_text": "<p>Clinical-dose NMN pre-paired with trimethylglycine - the methyl donor that lets NMN raise NAD+ without taxing your methylation pathway elsewhere.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Take NMN alone and you are running a hidden tax.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Take them together, the way Shanghai does, and you raise NAD+ cleanly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is Layer 2: the fuel for every repair you have left.</p>",
        "gg48ZbcKpd0_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-12.webp",
        "gg4Y6vnsthP_text": "AND THEN THE PUSHBACK STARTED",
        "gg5FNUIhGST_text": "<p>Individual results may vary*</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Catherine W.&nbsp; Palo Alto, California</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"I had tried NMN. I had tried Urolithin A. Neither one moved the needle alone. Three months on the full three-layer protocol and my sleep, energy, recovery, mood, and CRP have all shifted. I will be on this stack for the rest of my life.\"</p>",
        "gg6BqQxba9d_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/3_layer_32a93ee8-2f00-42c2-9137-87222ecc8537.webp",
        "gg6Y8HKx4KW_text": "<p>Think of your body as a precision machine that has been running on three failing systems at once.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By age forty, your <strong>mitochondria</strong> - the energy factories inside every cell - start piling up damaged units faster than your body can recycle them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The process that clears them out, called mitophagy, slows to a crawl.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Energy drops.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inflammation rises.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Recovery takes weeks instead of days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By 50, your <strong>NAD+</strong> levels - the molecular fuel that powers more than five hundred enzymatic reactions, including every single DNA-repair pathway you have - are roughly half what they were at twenty.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your sirtuins (the so-called longevity genes) literally cannot function without NAD+.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The repair crews are still on payroll.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They just have nothing left to work with.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By 60, your <strong>peptide signaling</strong> - the precise messengers that tell your tissues to repair, rebuild, and stay structurally strong - has collapsed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sleep architecture falls apart.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Collagen synthesis crawls.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wounds that healed in three days at thirty now take three weeks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The body forgets how to be young.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The longevity research community has known this since the 2013 Lopez-Otin paper The Hallmarks of Aging - the single most-cited paper in the field.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every supplement, drug, and protocol marketed to aging Americans over the last thirty years has tried to target <strong>one</strong> of these hallmarks at a time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>NAD+ boosters.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Resveratrol.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Senolytics.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Each one good at one thing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>None of them addressing the full picture.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Shanghai clusters figured out that you have to hit all three layers - mitochondrial cleanup, NAD+ restoration, peptide signaling - at the same time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the discovery.</p>",
        "gg7UWDDbtce_text": "<p>Individual results may vary*</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Catherine W.&nbsp; Palo Alto, California</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"I had tried NMN. I had tried Urolithin A. Neither one moved the needle alone. Three months on the full three-layer protocol and my sleep, energy, recovery, mood, and CRP have all shifted. I will be on this stack for the rest of my life.\"</p>",
        "gg8E-MszmLH_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/04._AAR_old_man_holding_products_81c9e7bc-3530-4ce5-bca3-454f1945ab7a.webp",
        "gg8XxY45a7L_childItem_0": "<p>Funding the concierge-clinic model.</p>",
        "gg8XxY45a7L_childItem_1": "<p>Subsidizing the supplement industry's single-compound margins.</p>",
        "gg8XxY45a7L_childItem_2": "<p>Watching another decade quietly disappear.</p>",
        "gg8oPYq92jl_text": "WHY EVERYTHING YOU'VE TRIED HAS QUIETLY FAILED&nbsp;",
        "gg9D6unGw81_text": "WHY THE WEALTHIEST PEOPLE ON EARTH ARE QUIETLY FLYING TO SHANGHAI",
        "gg9FYyGNI15_label": "<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg9xoXv2Izn_text": "<p><strong>Days 1–7: The Mitophagy Awakening.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Urolithin A activates the cellular recycling pathway that has been dormant since your forties.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Damaged mitochondria start clearing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The first thing most patients report — including James — is that the afternoon energy crash simply does not happen anymore.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Deep sleep, measured on an Oura ring, climbs 12–18% within the first week. <strong>Days 8–28: The NAD+ Surge.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>NMN + TMG drives tissue NAD+ levels back up toward where they were in your thirties.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mental clarity sharpens.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inflammatory markers (CRP) typically drop by 50–60%.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Patients report being able to read at ten p.m.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"the way they could in their forties.\" Resting heart rate falls 8–12 beats. <strong>Days 29–60: The Peptide Rebuild.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Longevity Peptide complex takes over.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Visible change.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Skin texture shifts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Jawline tightens.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lean tissue gains begin, fat loss begins - without changing training or diet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Spouses notice before patients do. <strong>Days 61–90: The Biological Age Drop.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The full ninety-day panel - TruDiagnostic epigenetic clock, full inflammatory panel, VO2 max, sleep architecture - comes back showing measured biological age reduction of 12 to 36 years against baseline.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is not exaggeration.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the average across roughly fourteen hundred patients I am now personally tracking.</p>",
        "ggA4qT-g2cQ_text": "<p>I have prescribed and reviewed every major longevity intervention available in the United States for the last decade.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Let me dismantle the single-compound options you have probably tried — and explain why none of them, on their own, has ever moved the needle for you the way the field promised they would.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>NMN alone.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Yes, it raises NAD+.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But taken without a methyl donor like TMG, it slowly depletes your methylation pathway, drives up homocysteine, and quietly costs you elsewhere.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most NMN brands on Amazon are also under-dosed by 60-70%.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Resveratrol.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Sinclair-era darling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Almost no clinically meaningful effect in humans without active sirtuin substrate (NAD+).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is the spark with no fuel — sold by the millions of bottles to people who never get the second compound.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Standard testosterone replacement.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Expensive — $200–400/month — and it addresses exactly one hormone while doing nothing for the underlying mitochondrial, NAD+, and peptide-signaling collapse driving the symptoms in the first place.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Concierge longevity clinics.</strong> $30,000 to $100,000 per year.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Marble lobbies, extensive labs, identical underlying protocol.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The science they are delivering is real.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The markup is the building you are sitting in.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>\"Anti-aging\" supplements off Amazon.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Astragalus.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Spermidine.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Berberine.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most are under-dosed by an order of magnitude.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>None of them address all three layers of the aging process.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You are paying for the label, not the compound.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every one of these treats a single mechanism while ignoring the other two layers that are still failing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why nothing has worked.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why your blood markers have not moved.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why the mirror keeps telling the same story.</p>",
        "ggAE0pJol8W_text": "<p>Individual results may vary*</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Catherine W.&nbsp; Palo Alto, California</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"I had tried NMN. I had tried Urolithin A. Neither one moved the needle alone. Three months on the full three-layer protocol and my sleep, energy, recovery, mood, and CRP have all shifted. I will be on this stack for the rest of my life.\"</p>",
        "ggCUbVmTRcb_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-03.webp",
        "ggCzOGqJ640_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/07._Ltc_AAR_SecA_Catherine_F._56_ece1a2c6-ecaf-44d0-9c76-91ced1cd21c1.webp",
        "ggDh6t0eibL_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(245,166,35)!important;\"><strong>★★★★★ </strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:#0C0C0C;\"><strong>4.8/5</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(101,103,107)!important;\"><strong> - 11,400+ verified customers</strong></span></p>",
        "ggDr27byezm_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-05.webp",
        "ggGyJEdQZhx_text": "<p>For five months I became a man possessed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I cancelled speaking engagements.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I read every available paper out of the Shanghai Institute of Biochemistry and Cell Biology, the Shanghai Institute of Materia Medica, and the longevity divisions attached to Fudan and ShanghaiTech Universities.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I personally reviewed labs, bloodwork, epigenetic clocks, inflammatory panels, and cardiac scans from seventeen patients who had gone through the Shanghai protocol.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The pattern was no longer deniable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Chinese government has poured a staggering amount of capital into translational longevity science over the last fifteen years, and unlike in the United States, where the field is fragmented across hundreds of competing private startups, Shanghai's major research institutions operate in coordinated clusters.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They share data.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They share results.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They run human trials at a speed that is simply not possible under the current FDA framework.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bryan Johnson - the man spending two million dollars a year on his Blueprint protocol — has publicly admitted the most advanced peptide work on Earth is being done in Shanghai.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Peter Attia has referenced it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So has David Sinclair.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They just don't say it on television.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why people who can afford a sixteen-hour flight on a private jet are taking it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And what they figured out - the genuinely important part - is that aging is not one process.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is at least twelve distinct biological processes happening at the same time, falling into three categories that must be addressed <strong>simultaneously, in sequence, with three different classes of compounds.</strong></p>",
        "ggJcXBnQuRR_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/05._Ltc_AAR_SecA_Maree_S._58_ef9dd776-4fc6-437d-8693-69659f488827.webp",
        "ggKExGY7UWi_text": "WORD SPREAD INSIDE THE FIELD",
        "ggLKnF_OxwX_text": "<p>A pharmaceutical-grade peptide complex sourced from the same manufacturer that supplies several Shanghai clinical programs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tells your body, at the molecular level, to start behaving the way it did fifteen years ago.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sleep deepens.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Recovery accelerates.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Skin elasticity returns.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lean tissue rebuilds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Miss even one layer and you stay stuck.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why every single-compound product on the market has failed you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why the full protocol works.</p>",
        "ggLLN4KPcQm_label": "<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggLUdJahV3U_label": "<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggLyP1kzePU_text": "HERE'S EXACTLY WHAT TO DO NEXT",
