        "ggNMASXq_zb_text": "<p><a href=\"https://wellnessnest.co/pages/ageaura-pure-protocol\"><strong><u>GET AGEAURA INTRODUCTORY PRICE NOW!</u></strong></a></p>",
        "ggNj5z5WJER_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-10_f0a3c8df-4fa5-48a2-b447-453f192b9caf.webp",
        "ggOGV6-TpTE_text": "3. AgeAura Pure Longevity Peptides - the Signaling Layer.",
        "ggP5EIbFShu_text": "THE INTRODUCTORY PRICE THAT BREAKS THE CONCIERGE MODEL",
        "ggPL5wbFxAr_text": "2. AgeAura Pure NMN + TMG - the NAD+ Restoration Pair.",
        "ggQ72b5RsRg_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(26,26,26);\">May 20th, 2026 | 9:14 AM EST</span></p>",
        "ggQluG8Rzkw_text": "<p>Remember those trade-association letters I mentioned?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The \"please reconsider your framing\" ones?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here is exactly what they are worried about.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The same three-compound protocol — full clinical dose on every layer — that the most expensive longevity clinics on Earth are quietly running on their highest-paying clients, available directly to your door at a fraction of one percent of the clinic cost.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No marble lobby.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No \"membership fee.\" No annual retainer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just the protocol.</p><p>For the ONLY protocol that addresses all three root layers of biological aging.</p><p>Why would I price it this way?</p>",
        "ggR4qXI5cZp_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-11.webp",
        "ggTWzlUMYsJ_text": "<p>It happened on a Tuesday afternoon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I had just finished rounds when my phone rang.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It was James Calloway - a longtime patient, sixty-four years old, retired managing partner of one of the largest private equity firms in the Northeast.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>James is the kind of man who plays squash four mornings a week, reads three medical journals for fun, and has never once missed his annual executive physical.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>He is also the kind of man who does not call his doctor in the middle of the day unless something is wrong.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"Marcus,\" he said, \"I need you to look at my numbers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I just got back from Shanghai.\" I almost laughed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"James, why on Earth were you in Shanghai?\" \"Because,\" he said, \"two of my partners have been going for the last eight months.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And Marcus - they don't look the same anymore.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm not talking about a tan.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm talking about the way their skin sits on their face.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The way they get out of a chair.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Last weekend I watched Bill - he's sixty-eight - beat his thirty-five-year-old son in straight sets.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have known Bill for twenty-two years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The man couldn't climb a flight of stairs without complaining about his knee last year.\" That was the call.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A week later, James was sitting in my office sliding a manila envelope across my desk.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inside was a TruDiagnostic epigenetic panel - baseline, and again ninety days later.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>His biological age had dropped from <strong>71.2 to 34.6.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thirty-six and a half years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In ninety days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have been doing this for a long time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have never seen numbers move like that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I picked up the phone and started making my own calls.</p>",
        "ggTt-JdzZXn_text": "HERE'S EXACTLY WHAT HAPPENS INSIDE YOUR BODY",
        "ggW54_5hbR3_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-08.webp",
        "ggWO4Yo5bjr_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/06._Ltc_AAR_SecA_Marco_R._48_a96acdec-3405-4a42-95e5-82eb15181c52.webp",
        "ggWpneNwPrV_text": "<p>Remember James?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Six weeks after I put him on the full three-layer Shanghai protocol, his wife noticed before he did.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She told him at breakfast that the texture of his skin had changed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>He looked in the mirror three times before he saw it himself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Day ninety: biological age 34.6.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>CRP 0.8.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>VO2 max 41.2.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Resting heart rate 58.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>His cardiologist - a colleague of mine at Mass General - called me directly and asked me to put his wife on it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The protocol is three compounds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Each one targets a different one of the three aging layers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Each one is dosed at the exact level the clinical literature actually demands.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And each one is useless without the other two.</p>",
        "ggXzjCFsY0__text": "<p>Your cells have waited long enough. Click below and let's start the reversal.</p>",
        "ggZ51QZVjAx_text": "<p>The longevity-clinic industry LOVES these structures.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Know why?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because you keep coming back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Annual membership.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Quarterly bloodwork at $1,200 a panel.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"Maintenance phase\" billing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The incentive is for you to stay in the program, not to get better.</p><p>I built the AgeAura Pure Protocol because I watched my own father lose his last ten years to a series of compounding small declines that were each, in isolation, treatable — and together, fatal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because my patients deserve access to the same Shanghai-grade three-layer protocol the wealthiest people on Earth are already running, without the flight.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because every year a person spends on single-compound supplements is a year they will not get back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because someone had to do this and nobody else was going to.</p>",
        "ggZCTHF9HxN_text": "<p>Individual results may vary*</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>James C.&nbsp; Boston, Massachusetts</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"I was the first patient on the full protocol. Day 90 panel: biological age dropped from 71.2 to 34.6. My cardiologist called my doctor and asked to be put on it himself. I have never had numbers like this in my life.\"</p>",
        "ggZQX9REEXO_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-13.webp",
        "ggas4yIE7e3_text": "<p>The Bryan Johnson Blueprint Route</p>",
        "ggazex4vYN1_text": "<p>Dear Friend Worried About Aging,&nbsp; If you're reading this with that quiet, creeping suspicion that something has shifted in your body over the last few years - the stiffness when you stand up, the afternoon fog that didn't used to be there, the face in the mirror that looks like it's settling in instead of still building - I want you to stop scrolling for a moment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I almost didn't write this letter.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As a longevity doctor with twenty-six years in translational biology, I am careful about what I put my name to.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But what I have watched happen in my own clinic over the last fourteen months, in the bloodwork of patients I have personally followed back from Shanghai, is something I cannot in good conscience keep quiet about.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So I'm going to tell you what I saw, what it means, and exactly what to do with this information - if you have the courage to actually act on it.</p>",
        "ggbfq2nVpjK_childItem_0": "<p>Fountain Life membership: $30,000 – $100,000 / year&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggbfq2nVpjK_childItem_1": "<p>Annual lab panels &amp; physician oversight: $4,000 – $8,000&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggbfq2nVpjK_childItem_2": "<p>Annual cost: $34,000 – $108,000/year - for the same underlying compound stack with a marble lobby attached.</p>",
        "ggc9YfnS1lQ_label": "<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggcv4D51bTY_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/05._AAR_side_by_side_8da60d90-3aa3-4bb2-b863-266c29e794f9.webp",
        "ggcvxJXV3b1_text": "<p>1. Click the button below that says <strong>\"Start My AgeAura Protocol\".</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2. Choose your bundle tier (single month, Buy 2 Get 1, Buy 3 Get 2, or the full year Practitioner tier).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>3. Enter your shipping (delivered in 48 hours from our North American fulfillment partner).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>4. Start Layer 1 (Urolithin A) on Day 1 — Layers 2 and 3 stack in from Day 4.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>5. Track sleep, energy, and recovery for the first 30 days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>6. At Day 90, pull a TruDiagnostic panel and compare it to your baseline.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the entire process.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Four bottles, three layers, ninety days, one new decade.</p><p>But whatever you do, do not close this page thinking \"I'll order later.\" Later doesn't exist when your biological clock is the one running out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The 1,847-bundle window will close.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The next batch will be priced higher.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Six months from now you will be six months further into a decline that is reversing itself for the people who decided today.</p>",
        "ggdKaUkKuAa_text": "THE RESULTS SPEAK FOR THEMSELVES",
        "ggeB7HxDJ5J_text": "<p>While the actual protocol is sitting right here, at less than a single Swiss clinic intake call.</p>",
        "ggepwZP0Hba_text": "MY PERSONAL 90-DAY \"GIVE ME BACK THE DECADE\" GUARANTEE",
        "ggf-rpOltkt_text": "<p>In the last fourteen months, more than 11,400 men and women have started the AgeAura Pure Protocol. <strong>92% report measurable energy, sleep, and recovery improvements within the first thirty days</strong>. 78% show a biological age reduction of more than ten years on a ninety-day TruDiagnostic panel.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Average CRP reduction across the cohort: 64%.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Average sleep efficiency gain: 19 percentage points.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But my favorite numbers are the stories that come in every single day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dr. Richard K., Internal Medicine, 19 years in practice.</strong> \"I do not endorse supplement protocols lightly. The AgeAura stack is the only one I have ever personally taken, recommended to my own mother, and put on my own intake form. The biomarker data is the most consistent thing I have seen in nineteen years.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Michael T., 54, Senior Project Manager.</strong> \"Three months ago I could not hike with my son without my knees flaring. Last weekend we summited a 9,000-foot peak and I did not take a single ibuprofen. My cardiologist asked what I was doing. I told him. He asked me to send him the link.\"</p>",
        "ggfHJUvxmgq_label": "<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggfRX_smaMq_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-07_11deebcc-a4a2-4170-817e-997e4ee7f40f.webp",
        "ggfeghWVOLj_text": "<p>With respect and the urgency that comes from twenty-six years of watching this disease move faster than the average patient is willing to act,&nbsp; Dr. Marcus Hale, MD&nbsp; Creator, AgeAura Pure Protocol&nbsp; Longevity Medicine &amp; Translational Biology</p>",
        "ggiaTUHaCpr_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-urolithin-lifestyle-man-gym.webp",
        "ggitijHaw8E_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-protocol-09.webp",
        "ggk1pM8Q6PO_text": "Top Longevity Doctors: \"This Is the Fastest Way to Reverse Biological Age - And It's Coming Out of Shanghai\"",
        "ggktXWJoQHn_text": "<p>The only compound ever proven in a Nature Metabolism human trial to directly activate mitochondrial recycling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Cleans damaged mitochondria out of your cells the way your body did at thirty. <strong>500 mg clinical</strong> <strong>dose</strong> - not the 100-250 mg cosmetic doses you see on Amazon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is Layer 1: you cannot rebuild a cell that has not first been cleaned.</p>",
        "ggl9xCMbVd__text": "<p>It is called the <strong>AgeAura Pure Protocol.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Three pharmaceutical-grade compounds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One daily ritual.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Clinical doses on every single ingredient.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Manufactured to the same specifications as the Shanghai-affiliated clinical programs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Available without the flight.</p>",
        "gglcBd-aRP1_childItem_0": "<p>Self-experiment protocol cost: ~$2,000,000 / year</p>",
        "gglcBd-aRP1_childItem_1": "<p>Personal team, chefs, sleep specialists, equipment: included in the above</p>",
        "gglcBd-aRP1_childItem_2": "<p>Annual cost: $2,000,000, and Bryan himself has publicly admitted the most advanced peptide work is being done in Shanghai, not in his Venice Beach lab.</p>",
        "gglngwj4pyo_text": "THE PRICE THAT MAKES CONCIERGE CLINICS UNCOMFORTABLE",
        "gglwH2hwsal_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(26,26,26);\">Written by Dr. Marcus Hale, MD | Longevity Medicine &amp; Translational Biology (26 years)</span></p>",
        "ggmjHR0lVRP_text": "<p>After James's panel came back, word got out the way it always does in a tight medical circle.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Slowly at first.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then quickly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Two cardiologists at Mass General asked me about it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A peptide-therapy MD in New York flew up to review the data.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By month four I had patients flying in from Los Angeles, Miami, and Vancouver.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By month eight I was tracking roughly fourteen hundred patients on the same three-layer protocol, every one of them showing measurable biological-age reduction in their first ninety days.</p>",
        "ggnvXL1eFo9_text": "<p>Right now, you are at a crossroads. <strong>Path #1: Keep Doing What You're Doing</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Keep stacking single-compound supplements.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Keep wondering why your bloodwork is not moving.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Keep watching the mirror tell the same story.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wake up a year from now stiffer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wake up five years from now in a difficult conversation with your cardiologist.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wake up ten years from now looking at the people who started in their fifties with a quiet, private regret that has no name. <strong>Path #2: Start the Three-Layer Protocol.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mitophagy + NAD+ + peptide signaling, addressed together, in sequence, every day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sleep differently in four weeks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Move differently in twelve.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Look differently in six months.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Be looked at differently in a year.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The numbers are real.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The cohort is real.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The path is real.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You only get to choose once.</p>",
        "ggoQO7xXFDV_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/3933de21-7e33-409a-b3a9-58a4443315d0_a7c6e167-4340-4427-bcf5-0bc02ae9ac77.webp",
        "ggoxdbvIp_G_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/producct.png",
        "ggozxRB27Hy_text": "THE PHONE CALL THAT CHANGED EVERYTHING I THOUGHT I KNEW ABOUT AGING…",
        "ggpeolMafjU_label": "<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggpfYzVSQPw_text": "<p>Let me show you what \"managing\" aging actually costs in America: The Concierge Clinic Route</p>",
        "ggr1bqyz81t_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/0._Ltc_AAR_hero_image_45bf906a-cb64-4731-80d4-f5cd1fd2fe52.webp",
        "ggsMgMkSoOf_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/06._AAR_bundle_image_d9370665-5cd8-40e6-807d-5225b873287d.webp",
        "gguIWjji01r_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(26,26,26);\">A three-compound longevity stack out of Shanghai is reversing biological age by 12–36 years in 90 days, without clinic membership fees, without injections, and without leaving home.</span></p>",
        "gguVo647Scn_text": "<p>Stock alert: only 1,847 protocol bundles remaining at this introductory price.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not because I am playing scarcity games.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because the peptide layer in particular is produced in small, pharmaceutical-grade batches and the next batch will be priced at the higher tier that reflects the actual current cost of peptide synthesis.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We have absorbed that cost for one final window.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After this one, we cannot.</p>",
        "gguZ94saKz0_text": "<p>The Private Swiss Longevity Clinic Route</p>",
        "gguZXVYcjy3_childItem_0": "<p>One-week intake at a top-tier Swiss clinic: €150,000 – €400,000</p>",
        "gguZXVYcjy3_childItem_1": "<p>Travel, accommodation, ongoing maintenance: additional</p>",
        "gguZXVYcjy3_childItem_2": "<p>And the protocol they put you on is, in most cases, sourced from the same Shanghai pharmaceutical-grade manufacturer that supplies us.</p>",
        "ggvAlc-ENwp_text": "THE 3-COMPOUND PROTOCOL HIDING IN PLAIN SIGHT",
        "ggvH5Y_KZqT_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(239, 242, 167, 0.77);\">ONLY 1,847 BUNDLES LEFT AT THIS PRICE</span></p>",
        "ggvtW4GIgjx_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-02.webp",
        "ggwXq-yaokN_alt": "Describes the appearance of the image",
        "ggwXq-yaokN_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/dr-marcus-hale.webp",
        "ggx4Ub_3LKV_text": "THE ONLY PROTOCOL THAT DELIVERS ALL THREE LAYERS",
        "ggxCU8HpCcr_label": "<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggxnVweLbbX_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(26,26,26);\">After 14 months of research and over 11,400 patients in the field, Dr. Marcus Hale's team has finally produced enough pharmaceutical-grade Layer-3 peptide supply to release the full AgeAura Pure Protocol to the North American public.</span></p>",
        "ggyMRDJMvf9_label": "<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggy_LEi-h-j_text": "1. AgeAura Pure Urolithin A - the Mitophagy Activator.",
        "ggzPsYUmks2_text": "<p>Because every patient who reverses their biological age is another data point that makes the concierge-clinic markup harder to defend.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because I want the protocol in the hands of people who could never afford a Swiss retreat, not just the people who can.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because the science is bigger than the business model around it.</p>"
      },
