    "gp_section_624092938162405918": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "85d9600c1368e89e7dfa3ae75ec3c0de1013c8dff8757ec8b63d59b3ad8e3a8a_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg0ealOmjwA_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);\">Yes. The AgeAura Pure Longevity Peptide complex is formulated entirely from peptide sequences and structural analogs that are legal for sale and consumption in the United States. We do not import any compound that is not compliant with current U.S. regulatory standards.</span></p>",
        "gg2tZlShtgb_childItem_0": "<p>How quickly should I expect to feel something?</p>",
        "gg2tZlShtgb_childItem_1": "<p>Is the protocol safe to start at my age? &nbsp;</p>",
        "gg2tZlShtgb_childItem_2": "<p>Why are all three compounds necessary? I just take one?</p>",
        "gg2tZlShtgb_childItem_3": "<p>What if doesn't work for me? &nbsp;</p>",
        "gg2tZlShtgb_childItem_4": "<p>Are the peptides legal in the United States?&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg2tZlShtgb_childItem_5": "<p>Can I take this with my existing supplements?&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg2tZlShtgb_childItem_6": "<p>Should I talk to my doctor first?&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg2tZlShtgb_childItem_7": "<p>How do I cancel my subscription?&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg2tZlShtgb_childItem_8": "<p>Do you ship internationally?&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg4wzohzM2n_text": "<p>Run the full three-layer AgeAura Pure Protocol for 90 days. If you don't see the shifts I describe in this letter, just email support@wellnessnest.co with your order number. We process a full refund within 48 hours — no forms, no \"store credit,\" no questions asked. We can offer this guarantee because, in practice, our return rate runs under 2%.</p>",
        "ggCaGW5zvku_text": "<p>In most cases, yes — Urolithin A, NMN + TMG, and the peptide complex are designed to integrate with the foundational supplement stack most longevity-aware patients are already running (vitamin D, magnesium, omega-3, etc.). The protocol replaces, and is significantly more effective than, the single-compound NMN and Urolithin A products most patients arrive with.</p>",
        "ggFaUzJkBBU_text": "<p>The three compounds in the AgeAura Pure Protocol — Urolithin A, NMN + TMG, and the Longevity Peptide complex — have been studied in human clinical trials in adults from age 40 through age 85. The Shanghai-affiliated programs work routinely with patients well into their seventies. If you're on prescription medication — particularly blood thinners or immunosuppressants — please discuss with your physician before starting.</p>",
        "ggN56eWvhKn_text": "<p>You can — and many people do — and they get partial results. But the science is now clear: mitophagy, NAD+ restoration, and peptide signaling are three different layers of the aging process. Addressing one without the other two is like cleaning an engine but never refilling the oil. The full protocol is engineered to work as a stack, in sequence, every day.</p>",
        "ggY6e-biqko_text": "<p>Currently we ship to the United States and Canada within 48 hours from our North American fulfillment partner. International shipping (UK, EU, Australia) is in private beta — email support@wellnessnest.co to be added to the international waitlist.</p>",
        "ggd1SYqUR7b_text": "<p>In my own practice, roughly 70% of patients describe a noticeable shift in afternoon energy and sleep depth within the first 7 to 10 days. Recovery and joint comfort shifts typically land between days 14 and 28. The visible tissue, skin, and biomarker changes — the changes that show up in a mirror or a panel — typically arrive between week 6 and week 12. The full ninety-day arc is what we measure against.</p>",
        "ggxVtKnAyua_text": "<p>In most cases, yes — Urolithin A, NMN + TMG, and the peptide complex are designed to integrate with the foundational supplement stack most longevity-aware patients are already running (vitamin D, magnesium, omega-3, etc.). The protocol replaces, and is significantly more effective than, the single-compound NMN and Urolithin A products most patients arrive with.</p>",
        "ggxlCPWqErs_text": "FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS",
        "ggzvKOEt6La_text": "<p>Bundle tiers (Buy 2 Get 1, Buy 3 Get 2, Buy 6 Get 6) are one-time orders at the listed price. If you choose the automatic refill option, you can cancel anytime from your account with two clicks. No phone trees. No retention scripts.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-624092938162405918"
    },
