        "gg2kISXo-t6_text": "<p>THIS IS AN ADVERTISEMENT AND NOT AN ACTUAL NEWS ARTICLE, BLOG, OR CONSUMER PROTECTION UPDATE. The information provided in this advertorial is for educational purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Statements regarding biological age reversal have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. Individual results vary substantially. Consult your physician before starting any new supplement protocol, particularly if you take prescription medication.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
